{"id":"melonds","name":"melonDS","tagline":"Nintendo DS and DSi emulator","blurb":"melonDS aims at providing fast and accurate Nintendo DS emulation.","description":"melonDS aims at providing fast and accurate Nintendo DS emulation. While it is still a work in progress, it has a pretty solid set of features.\n\n• Nearly complete core (CPU, video, audio, ...)\n\n• OpenGL renderer, 3D upscaling\n\n• RTC, microphone, lid close/open\n\n• Joystick support\n\n• Savestates\n\n• Various display position/sizing/rotations modes\n\n• Work-in-progress Wi-Fi emulation for online connectivity and local multiplayer\n\n• Experimental emulation of the Nintendo DSi\n\n• ...and even more is planned!","developer":"Arisotura","icon":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/net/kuribo64/melonDS/81b115ecef228fbc787c03d4808282f4/icons/128x128/net.kuribo64.melonDS.png","screenshots":[{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/net/kuribo64/melonDS/81b115ecef228fbc787c03d4808282f4/screenshots/image-1_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/net/kuribo64/melonDS/81b115ecef228fbc787c03d4808282f4/screenshots/image-1_224x356@1.png","w":534,"h":851},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/net/kuribo64/melonDS/81b115ecef228fbc787c03d4808282f4/screenshots/image-2_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/net/kuribo64/melonDS/81b115ecef228fbc787c03d4808282f4/screenshots/image-2_224x356@1.png","w":534,"h":851},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/net/kuribo64/melonDS/81b115ecef228fbc787c03d4808282f4/screenshots/image-3_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/net/kuribo64/melonDS/81b115ecef228fbc787c03d4808282f4/screenshots/image-3_224x356@1.png","w":534,"h":851},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/net/kuribo64/melonDS/81b115ecef228fbc787c03d4808282f4/screenshots/image-4_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/net/kuribo64/melonDS/81b115ecef228fbc787c03d4808282f4/screenshots/image-4_1248x681@1.png","w":1558,"h":851}],"categories":["Games"],"tags":["game","emulator"],"license":"GPL-3.0","p